143	// A rule is `{ name, appliesTo(entry) }` plus, for the whole-diff rules, a
144	// `constraint(coveredEntries)` returning null or the reason it fails. `appliesTo`
145	// answers both roles a policy can use the name in: as an allow term it covers the
146	// files it applies to, as a `reject:` term it vetoes on them.
